ng your content creation soar to new heights.'=>'Jetpack AI Assistant brings the power of AI right into your WordPress editor, letting your content creation soar to new heights.','Jetpack AI'=>'Jetpack AI','<p>Paid customers get dedicated email support from our world-class Happiness Engineers to help with any issue.</p>
						 <p>All other questions are handled by our team as quickly as we are able to go through the WordPress support forum.</p>'=>'<p>Paid customers get dedicated email support from our world-class Happiness Engineers to help with any issue.</p>
						 <p>All other questions are handled by our team as quickly as we are able to go through the WordPress support forum.</p>','Dedicated email support'=>'Dedicated email support','Deliver images from Jetpack\'s Content Delivery Network. Automatically resizes your images to an appropriate size, converts them to modern efficient formats like WebP, and serves them from a worldwide network of servers.'=>'Deliver images from Jetpack\'s Content Delivery Network. Automatically resizes your images to an appropriate size, converts them to modern efficient formats like WebP, and serves them from a worldwide network of servers.','Image CDN'=>'Image CDN','Discover and fix images with a suboptimal resolution, aspect ratio, or file size, improving user experience and page speed.'=>'Discover and fix images with a suboptimal resolution, aspect ratio, or file size, improving user experience and page speed.','Image guide'=>'Image guide','Run non-essential JavaScript after the page has loaded so that styles and images can load more quickly.'=>'Run non-essential JavaScript after the page has loaded so that styles and images can load more quickly.','Defer non-essential JavaScript'=>'Defer non-essential JavaScript','<p>It’s essential to regenerate Critical CSS to optimize your site speed whenever your HTML or CSS structure changes. Being on top of this can be tedious and time-consuming.</p>
								 <p>Boost’s cloud service can automatically detect when your site needs the Critical CSS regenerated, and perform this function behind the scenes without requiring you to monitor it manually.</p>'=>'<p>It’s essential to regenerate Critical CSS to optimise your site speed whenever your HTML or CSS structure changes. Being on top of this can be tedious and time-consuming.</p>
								 <p>Boost’s cloud service can automatically detect when your site needs the Critical CSS regenerated, and perform this function behind the scenes without requiring you to monitor it manually.</p>','Automatic Critical CSS regeneration'=>'Automatic Critical CSS regeneration','<p>To enhance the speed of your site, with this plan you will need to optimize CSS by using the Manual Critical CSS generation feature whenever you:</p>
								<ul>
									<li>Make theme changes.</li>
									<li>Write a new post/page.</li>
									<li>Edit a post/page.</li>
									<li>Activate, deactivate, or update plugins that impact your site layout or HTML structure.</li>
									<li>Change settings of plugins that impact your site layout or HTML structure.</li>
									<li>Upgrade your WordPress version if the new release includes core CSS changes.</li>
								</ul>'=>'<p>To enhance the speed of your site, with this plan you will need to optimise CSS by using the Manual Critical CSS generation feature whenever you:</p>
								<ul>
									<li>Make theme changes.</li>
									<li>Write a new post/page.</li>
									<li>Edit a post/page.</li>
									<li>Activate, deactivate, or update plugins that impact your site layout or HTML structure.</li>
									<li>Change settings of plugins that impact your site layout or HTML structure.</li>
									<li>Upgrade your WordPress version if the new release includes core CSS changes.</li>
								</ul>','Manual Critical CSS regeneration'=>'Manual Critical CSS regeneration','Move important styling information to the start of the page, which helps pages display your content sooner, so your users don’t have to wait for the entire page to load. Commonly referred to as Critical CSS.'=>'Move important styling information to the start of the page, which helps pages display your content sooner, so your users don’t have to wait for the entire page to load. Commonly referred to as Critical CSS.','Source URL: %1$s'=>'Source URL: %1$s','IP Address: %1$s'=>'IP Address: %1$s','Time: %1$s'=>'Time: %1$s','HTTP %d while communicating with WordPress.com'=>'HTTP %d while communicating with WordPress.com','The url parameter is required'=>'The url parameter is required','Invalid response from WPCOM API while polling for speed scores'=>'Invalid response from WPCOM API while polling for speed scores','Paid Subscribers'=>'Paid Subscribers','Ask'=>'Ask','Delete permanently'=>'Delete permanently','Mark as spam'=>'Mark as spam','Some themes and plugins have <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">known conflicts</a> with Jetpack – check the list. (You can also browse the <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jetpack support pages</a> or <a href="%3$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jetpack support forum</a> to see if others have experienced and solved the problem.)'=>'Some themes and plugins have <a href="%1$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">known conflicts</a> with Jetpack – check the list. (You can also browse the <a href="%2$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jetpack support pages</a> or <a href="%3$s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jetpack support forum</a> to see if others have experienced and solved the problem.)','We strive to live by the <a href="https://automattic.com/creed/" target="_blank" class="jptracks" data-jptracks-name="jetpack_about_creed" rel="noopener noreferrer">Automattic Creed